# NOT NEEDED — the local stack reuses your existing agent/.env (AGENT_PROXY_TOKEN, TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN,
# JHW_PROXY_BASE). You do not fill anything. Just run:
#   docker compose -f docker-compose.local.yml up --build
#
# OPTIONAL — only if you want a different model/provider than the DO proxy default (deepseek-3.2),
# add to agent/.env:  MODEL_NAME=...   MODEL_PROVIDER=openrouter   OPENROUTER_API_KEY=sk-or-...
